  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YAL - Mutanje - SolarPipo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Renewable Energy/ Retail .Beneficiaries: YAL Youth 1202 of which 601 are women..Breakdown - .Volunteer Staff: 2.Suppliers/Distributors: 220.Project Customers: 1,000 ..The grant will encourage and facilitate the growth of solar power in Africa by the development of an app ensuring consumers are connected to the right product. The purpose of the Project is to change the way energy products purchase decisions are made, how energy products are accessed and ensuring consumers are getting products they need and energy companies are providing right fit products to consumers..Funding: .The grant funds will be used to: (a) for the training of 200 collection point agents; (b) extensive marketing campaign both digital and print to raise product awareness; and (d) the purchase of software and hardware in addition to technical assistance to finalize mobile application. .</narrative>
  </description>
